OL,3,GNEWSAAppointment delays 'a risk' for
OL,4,Ahospital patients
OL,5,
OL,6,FPatients at Derby and Burton hospitals
OL,7,Fare being put at risk by almost 100,000
OL,8,Foverdue follow-up appointments, local
OL,9,FNHS leaders have said.
OL,11,FAccording to recent board papers,
OL,12,FUniversity Hospitals of Derby and
OL,13,FBurton NHS Foundation Trust (UHDB) was
OL,14,Fgrappling with a "concerning" number of
OL,15,F98,722 overdue appointments at the end
OL,16,Fof October, compared to a target of
OL,17,F85,474 - described as "off-plan and
OL,18,Fworse than last year".
OL,20,FA meeting of the NHS Trust's leaders on
OL,21,FTuesday heard the delays were a "risk
OL,22,Fto patient care".
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,362,360,200,160,0,100
