OL,3,GNEWSAAppointment delays 'a risk' for
OL,4,Ahospital patients
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a statement, Dr Gis Robinson,
OL,7,Fexecutive chief medical officer,
OL,8,Facknowledged that waiting longer for
OL,9,Ffollow-up appointments was "worrying
OL,10,Fand frustrating" for patients' ongoing
OL,11,Fcare.
